<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong February merchandise trade figures.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong February merchandise trade figures.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department released the following figures for merchandise trade (rounded figures in billions of H.K. dollars and year-on-year percentage change) (*** denotes less than 0.05 percent)</p>
<p>					 Feb 1997	   Jan 1997</p>
<p>Re-exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				 25.39 (+11.7)    36.59 (- 1.8)</p>
<p> U.S.				  15.15 ( *** )    19.65 (+11.5)</p>
<p> Japan				  5.54 (-11.6)     7.15 (+ 3.6)</p>
<p> Germany				3.24 (-10.7)     4.06 (- 8.6)</p>
<p> U.K.				   2.23 (- 6.0)     2.83 (+ 1.0)</p>
</text>
